  <string name="sync_protocol_help">The server must support GET, PUT, strong ETags and conditional uploads. Use the same file and recovery phrase on each device. Sync starts manually. After pairing, edits and deletions are included. Choose which version to keep when changes conflict. Keep the recovery phrase: without it, recovery is impossible.</string>
