  <string name="sync_preview">Conflicts: %1$d. Local bookmarks or shortcuts to remove: %2$d.\n\nEdits and deletions since the last sync are merged. If the same website changed differently on both devices, choose the local or server version. Nothing is overwritten without version checks.</string>
